{"cantica":"paradiso","cantoNumber":23,"title":"Canto XXIII","totalDuration":344.239,"segments":[{"id":10,"speaker":"narrator","text":"Like a bird among beloved leaves,\nquiet on the nest of her sweet brood\nthroughout the night that hides all things from us—\nwho, longing to see their cherished faces\nand find the food to nourish them\n(in which grave labors become her joy),\nanticipates the dawn on open branch\nand waits for sun with burning desire,\ngazing intently as the first light breaks—\nSo my Lady stood, erect and watchful,\nturned toward that zone beneath which\nthe sun displays its slower course.\nSeeing her so rapt and yearning,\nI became like one who desires something,\nyearning and hoping to be satisfied.\nBut brief was the time between\nmy waiting and my seeing\nthe heavens grow more radiant.\nAnd Beatrice cried out:","startTime":0,"endTime":45.726,"words":[{"word":"Like","start":0.081,"end":0.321},{"word":"a","start":0.321,"end":0.481},{"word":"bird","start":0.481,"end":0.961},{"word":"among","start":0.961,"end":1.201},{"word":"beloved","start":1.201,"end":1.761},{"word":"leaves,","start":1.761,"end":2.721},{"word":"quiet","start":2.721,"end":3.161},{"word":"on","start":3.161,"end":3.281},{"word":"the","start":3.281,"end":3.441},{"word":"nest","start":3.441,"end":3.721},{"word":"of","start":3.721,"end":3.841},{"word":"her","start":3.841,"end":4.081},{"word":"sweet","start":4.081,"end":4.481},{"word":"brood","start":4.481,"end":4.881},{"word":"throughout","start":4.881,"end":5.281},{"word":"the","start":5.281,"end":5.441},{"word":"night","start":5.441,"end":5.761},{"word":"that","start":5.761,"end":5.921},{"word":"hides","start":5.921,"end":6.321},{"word":"all","start":6.321,"end":6.641},{"word":"things","start":6.641,"end":6.961},{"word":"from","start":6.961,"end":7.201},{"word":"us—","start":7.201,"end":8.081},{"word":"who,","start":8.081,"end":8.801},{"word":"longing","start":8.801,"end":9.281},{"word":"to","start":9.281,"end":9.441},{"word":"see",