041},{"word":"more","start":43.041,"end":43.281},{"word":"radiant.","start":43.281,"end":44.241},{"word":"And","start":44.241,"end":44.481},{"word":"Beatrice","start":44.481,"end":44.961},{"word":"cried","start":44.961,"end":45.281},{"word":"out:","start":45.281,"end":45.641}]},{"id":11,"speaker":"beatrice","text":"\"Behold\nthe hosts of Christ's triumph,\nall the fruit gathered by these turning spheres!\"","startTime":45.726,"endTime":52.606,"words":[{"word":"\"Behold","start":45.726,"end":46.446},{"word":"the","start":46.446,"end":46.686},{"word":"hosts","start":46.686,"end":47.166},{"word":"of","start":47.166,"end":47.406},{"word":"Christ's","start":47.406,"end":47.966},{"word":"triumph,","start":47.966,"end":49.086},{"word":"all","start":49.086,"end":49.406},{"word":"the","start":49.406,"end":49.646},{"word":"fruit","start":49.646,"end":50.126},{"word":"gathered","start":50.126,"end":50.686},{"word":"by","start":50.686,"end":50.886},{"word":"these","start":50.886,"end":51.086},{"word":"turning","start":51.086,"end":51.566},{"word":"spheres!\"","start":51.566,"end":52.606}]},{"id":12,"speaker":"narrator","text":"Her face seemed all aflame to me,\nher eyes so full of ecstasy\nthat I must pass on without describing them.\nAs when in clear nights of the full moon\nTrivia smiles among eternal nymphs\nwho paint the sky through all its depths,\nI saw above countless lamps\na Sun that kindled every one,\njust as our sun lights the stars above.\nThrough that living light there shone\na substance so intensely bright,\nso clear into my sight,\nthat I could not endure it.","startTime":52.606,"endTime":80.64,"words":[{"word":"Her","start":52.801,"end":53.041},{"word":"face","start":53.041,"end":53.401},{"word":"seemed","start":53.401,"end":53.761},{"word":"all","start":53.761,"end":53.961},{"word":"aflame","start":53.961,"end":54.481},{"word":"to","start":54.481,"end":54.641},{"word":"me,","start":54.641,"end":55.121},{"word":"her","start":55.121,"end":55.281},{"word":"eyes"