d":15,"speaker":"beatrice","text":"\"What overwhelms you\nis a power from which nothing shields itself.\nHere are the wisdom and the might\nthat opened pathways between heaven and earth,\nfor which there had been such long yearning.\"","startTime":85.409,"endTime":99.649,"words":[{"word":"\"What","start":85.409,"end":85.809},{"word":"overwhelms","start":85.809,"end":86.609},{"word":"you","start":86.609,"end":87.009},{"word":"is","start":87.009,"end":87.169},{"word":"a","start":87.169,"end":87.329},{"word":"power","start":87.329,"end":87.969},{"word":"from","start":87.969,"end":88.249},{"word":"which","start":88.249,"end":88.529},{"word":"nothing","start":88.529,"end":89.089},{"word":"shields","start":89.089,"end":89.569},{"word":"itself.","start":89.569,"end":90.769},{"word":"Here","start":90.769,"end":91.249},{"word":"are","start":91.249,"end":91.409},{"word":"the","start":91.409,"end":91.569},{"word":"wisdom","start":91.569,"end":92.369},{"word":"and","start":92.369,"end":92.489},{"word":"the","start":92.489,"end":92.689},{"word":"might","start":92.689,"end":93.369},{"word":"that","start":93.369,"end":93.569},{"word":"opened","start":93.569,"end":94.169},{"word":"pathways","start":94.169,"end":94.929},{"word":"between","start":94.929,"end":95.249},{"word":"heaven","start":95.249,"end":95.729},{"word":"and","start":95.729,"end":95.969},{"word":"earth,","start":95.969,"end":96.769},{"word":"for","start":96.769,"end":97.009},{"word":"which","start":97.009,"end":97.329},{"word":"there","start":97.329,"end":97.489},{"word":"had","start":97.489,"end":97.649},{"word":"been","start":97.649,"end":97.969},{"word":"such","start":97.969,"end":98.449},{"word":"long","start":98.449,"end":98.929},{"word":"yearning.\"","start":98.929,"end":99.649}]},{"id":16,"speaker":"narrator","text":"Like fire bursting from a cloud,\nexpanding till it finds no room within,\nand falls to earth against its nature,\nso my mind, growing large among those feasts,\nissued from itself,\nand what it b